    "detailed_description": "It's your friend Bab's birthday!<br />\r\nParty House is a 3D point-and-click game, where you collect all cakes, and optionally powerups.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou come visit Bab at his home, and takes you to his basement. He says he dropped all cakes!<br />\r\nYour task is to find all cakes and give them back to Bab, but Bab thinks you are trying to steal them...<br />\r\nThere are 4 randomly-generated basements, and once beating them, you win!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse powerups on the tables that do things, from becoming faster to stopping Bab from catching you!<br />\r\nEvery level, the basement gets bigger, because Bab actively works on expanding his basement. So every year it's bigger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach level is randomly generated, meaning every time you play, the basement will be different!",
